# Keep root docker build context small (ship-to-market + Dockerfile).
# The image only needs products/ghcr-console/**.
**
!products/
!products/ghcr-console/
!products/ghcr-console/**
products/ghcr-console/node_modules
products/ghcr-console/.next
products/ghcr-console/tests
# Self-hosted CI dispatcher image (ops/self-hosted-ci/Dockerfile, built on Railway).
!ops/
!ops/self-hosted-ci/
!ops/self-hosted-ci/**
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/npm-debug.log*
# 2026-11-11 MarketShipper WR #18330: the affiliate-hub image copies this
# product and the file: packages it installs. The ** rule above would hide
# them, and Docker then fails COPY. ghcr-console stays the only other product
# in the context.
!products/affiliate-hub/
!products/affiliate-hub/**
!packages/
!packages/**
# Last match wins. The un-ignore above would otherwise send a dev checkout's
# node_modules, .next, and .env* into the build context and overwrite the
# Linux tree produced by npm ci. These excludes must stay below the un-ignore.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/npm-debug.log*
